        "original_id": "c00be191-207a-522c-8d3c-3563a4b08798",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Portuguese Podengo, Russo-European Laika, Andalusian Hound, Ibizan Hound, Podenco Canario, Maneto\n- Places: Portugal, northern Europe, Russia, Iberia\n- Concepts: hunting dogs, hound breeds, landrace Laika dogs, Spitz type\n\nFacts:\n- The Portuguese Podengo is an ancient multi-sensory hound breed from Portugal that uses both sight and scent.\n- The Russo-European Laika is a hunting dog breed that originated in the forested region of northern Europe and Russia.\n- The Russo-European Laika is one of several breeds developed from landrace Laika dogs of very ancient Spitz type.\n- The Andalusian Hound is similar to the Ibizan Hound, the Portuguese Podengo, the Podenco Canario, and the Maneto.",
